"Inventory options allow you to set a default active or inactive state for"
" certain discovered resources. The list of available resources to "
"configure will vary based on the Cloud type and its supported resources. "
"By default, all possible resources for the Cloud type will be discovered "
"in an active state. Uncheck the box for some or all resources to discover"
" them in an inactive state. The list of potential resources that may "
"appear include:"
msgstr ""
"Inventory opciones allow you to set un predeterminado activo o inactivo "
"state para certain discovered recursos. The lista of disponible recursos "
"to configure será vary basado en el Cloud tipo y its compatible recursos."
" By predeterminado, todos possible recursos para el Cloud tipo será be "
"discovered in un activo state. Desmarque la box para algunos o todos "
"recursos to discover them in un inactivo state. The lista of potential "
"recursos que puede appear include:"

